      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Recording rules in use** (defined in `monitoring/prometheus/rules/recording-rules.yml`):\n\n- `job:infrawatch_http_request_rate5m` \u2014 total API throughput\n- `job:infrawatch_http_error_ratio5m` \u2014 5xx share of requests\n- `job:infrawatch_http_latency_p95_5m` \u2014 95th percentile latency\n- `route:infrawatch_http_request_rate5m` \u2014 per-route throughput\n- `job:nginx_requests:rate5m` \u2014 Nginx requests per second\n\n**Try in Explore:**\n\n```promql\ntopk(5, sum by (route) (rate(infrawatch_http_requests_total[10m])))\nhistogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(infrawatch_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))\nsum by (platform, environment) (infrawatch_servers_total)\n```\n\nApplication metrics come from the FastAPI `/metrics` endpoint (custom instrumentation), Nginx metrics from `nginx-prometheus-exporter`, and host metrics from Node/windows_exporter."
      },
